  unitName: Dark Spider
  unitId: 60261
  unitNumber: 639
  description: A gigantic arachnid demon that digs its nest underground. Not the
    usual kind of spider, this abomination is actually believed to have been born
    from a type of demon species. Since the entrance to its nest is cleverly hidden
    under dirt and dried leaves, it sprays its web from underground to trap any creatures
    passing by. With a web tougher than steel itself, it brings its prey into its
    nest and slowly melts the living creature alive with its digestive juices.
  summonDesc: '*Creak* *creak*<br>Kssh...Kssh!'
